<title>USA: First Merchants hires Salomon to examine options.</title>
<headline>First Merchants hires Salomon to examine options.</headline>
<dateline>DEERFIELD, Ill. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Merchants Acceptance Corp said it hired Salomon Brothers to help identify financing solutions and alternatives for the company.</p>
<p>The auto finance firm could not be reached for further comment.</p>
<p>First Merchants, which said earlier this month that it had discovered accounting irregularities in its books, faces several related lawsuits.</p>
<p>Its shares closed Monday up 5/16 at 3-1/16 on the over-the-counter market. The stock's 52-week high was 25-1/4.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
